cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mdconvert: layout aware conversion of scientific PDFs to Markdown"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Khaing
    given-names: Win
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1636-1807"
repository-code: "https://github.com/your-username/mdconvert-skill"
abstract: >-
  A Claude skill and standalone extractor that converts born-digital scientific
  PDFs into structured Markdown, preserving multi-column reading order,
  paragraph integrity, tables, figures with descriptions, display formulas and
  numbered references.
keywords:
  - pdf
  - markdown
  - document conversion
  - layout analysis
  - scientific publishing
  - claude skill
license: MIT
